  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "The Barrage of News Surrounding the Market Can Be Overwhelming",
  "body_html": "<p>Some of you <em><strong>DON’T</strong> </em>need to hear this. Some of you do. The constant barrage of terrible news…especially the last few years…can overwhelm people. You may have saw my quick note this weekend…to take a breath. There is nothing you or I, or anyone can do about the news. Do not let it overwhelm you…or dictate your actions with your portfolio. </p><p>Often times, when you and I read the news, its been priced in, well in advance. My speculation is that the U.S. attack on Iran, was likely priced in last week. I know that sounds crazy…but there is some nerd…somewhere in the world…that was likely monitoring something like fuel transfers to B-52 bombers, and that information made it to institutions. Something amongst those lines. </p><p>Could the market tank? Yes…my blow off top, meltdown speculation remains. Am I still bearing on oil? Yes…the macro trend remains pointing down. Could those speculations be wrong? YES. And that is why, PRICE ACTION IS ALWAYS KING!</p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
